  "_note": "V2 standardized 5TH contract shape (_format: zeus.chat_request.v2). Terminating returns MUST emit query_decomposition (intent facets) + decomposition for the evidence loop / hot-path analytics (EVIDENCE_LOOP_AB_AND_HOTPATH_ANALYTICS). guidance.query_decomposition documents the facet schema (full profile). (MIN profile: trimmed for size; evidence-loop return contract kept in system prompt)",
